      "mergeID": "6a0493e6b845b4bb5efe52fe",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Joining friends through portals is always fun, but I believe it would be nice to know where exactly you're going before you go somewhere. I think clicking on a portal with your quick menu open should open the world's details. You can predownload a world before you go through the portal, you can favorite a world in case you choose not to go through but you're still interested at some other point, or to just read what the world is about before you head in with your friends. I think this would be beneficial for everybody and I hope to see this feature implemented at some point in the near future!",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Clicking Portals With Quick Menu Opens World Info",
